#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:5 563b01fb5e504025ac55316a4bced9d7
msgid "Sailing Vehicles Home"
msgstr "帆船主页"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:7 73cf725d89cc489e9feea097ee71fa5b
msgid ""
"ArduRover now supports sailing vehicles, both on water and land. It is "
"recommended that the user familiarizes themselves with the basic principles "
"and terminology of sailing and sailboats."
msgstr "ArduRover 现已支持帆船，包括水上和陆地帆船。建议用户先熟悉帆船的基本原理和术语。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:17 b1f1118d48004125bdaf6a40ef4431af
msgid "Try it in the simulator:"
msgstr "在模拟器中试用："

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:18 1ed07652d1334c8aac231ae3718ef856
msgid ""
"ArduRover has a basic sailboat simulator, this can be launched directly from"
" Mission Planner. It is a great way to try out the functionality before "
"building your own vehicle, especially if you are new to ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"ArduRover 内置基本帆船模拟器，可直接从 Mission Planner 启动。在构建实体车辆前，这是试用功能的好方法，尤其适合 "
"ArduPilot 新手。"

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:25 fa871924a1a448ae84d380142447c7b7
msgid "Before you proceed:"
msgstr "开始前请注意："

#: ../../source/docs/sailboat-home.rst:26 56e264e6e8984fea8d9f939d008237f6
msgid ""
"Sailboat support is available in Stable releases at this time. Please bear "
"in mind that the code may still have some issues."
msgstr "目前稳定版本中提供帆船支持。请注意代码可能仍存在一些问题。"
